The customer reviews have been successfully classified into the specified financial service categories, and a JSON Schema has been generated for structuring the classified data. 

Here are the classification results and the corresponding JSON Schema:

### Classified Reviews:

- **Mortgages**:
  - Review ID: 001
    - Text: "I recently applied for a mortgage through this company and was impressed with the competitive rates and excellent customer service."
    - Category: mortgages

- **Personal Loans**:
  - Review ID: 002
    - Text: "Their personal loan application process was quick and simple. I got the funds I needed to consolidate my debt."
    - Category: personal loans

- **Credit Cards**:
  - Review ID: 003
    - Text: "I've been using their credit card for a year now and have accumulated a significant amount of rewards points. Highly recommend!"
    - Category: credit cards

- **Investment Accounts**:
  - Review ID: 004
    - Text: "Very satisfied with my investment account performance; the financial advisors are knowledgeable and proactive."
    - Category: investment accounts

### JSON Schema:

```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "Classified Financial Service Reviews",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "mortgages": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/review"
      }
    },
    "personal loans": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/review"
      }
    },
    "credit cards": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/review"
      }
    },
    "investment accounts": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/definitions/review"
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "review": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["review_id", "text", "category"],
      "properties": {
        "review_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "category": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

This schema defines the structure for storing the reviews categorized under mortgages, personal loans, credit cards, and investment accounts. You can use this schema for coherent data parsing and storage in your system.

